d and a /doctor check for trimming CLAUDE.md files\n- Improved /commit-push-pr to auto-allow git push to the repo's configured push remote\n\n**Comprehensive Changelog Sources:**\n\nYou can find the complete changelog at:\n- **Gradually.ai**: https://www.gradually.ai/en/changelogs/claude-code/ (tracks all 341+ releases)\n- **Tech Dev Notes**: https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code (39 releases tracked)\n- **Official Claude Code Documentation**: Various community resources track the full changelog history\n\nRecent patch releases include v2.1.220 with internal auto-mode classifier work, and v2.1.219 with early wiring for Claude Opus 5 and tighter memory behavior.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"8db3cdd0-9e15-4623-945d-db5e632d8b75","timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:54:17.646Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7dcdabd0-1201-4e5d-8285-5dcc9483dbf2","cwd":"/work","sessionId":"bd4d4fbc-e731-4f16-97fb-3abb3b21dadb"}
